zoe (devex): Heads-up: our Next edge sample started throwing ERR_PACKAGE_PATH_NOT_EXPORTED after the package.json exports tweak.

pete (eng): What's in the exports block?

zoe (devex): Paste: ```json
"exports": {
  "./package.json": "./package.json",
  "./*": {
    "node": "./build/cjs/*.cjs",
    "default": "./build/esm/*.js"
  }
}
```

ina (eng-runtime): Wildcard+conditional. Edge bundlers often need an explicit root (".") mapping. Without it the resolver doesn't map the bare import to a concrete file.

pete (eng): Quick fix: add a top-level entry: ```json
"exports": {
  ".": {"import":"./build/esm/index.js","require":"./build/cjs/index.cjs"},
  "./package.json":"./package.json"
}
```

zoe (devex): That fixed the preview deploy. I'll open a PR with the change + a tiny esbuild smoke test.

